features  
	cellphone  
		optional  
			wireless  
				or  
					infrared  
					bluetooth  
		mandatory  
			accu_cell  
				alternative  
					li_ion  
					ni_mh  
					ni_ca  
		mandatory  
			display  
				alternative  
					color  
					monochrome  
		mandatory  
			camera  
				optional  
					front  
					back  
		optional  
			battery_pack  
				or  
					quick_charge  
					solar_charge  
constraints  
	bluetooth requires li_ion  
	color excludes ni_ca  
	camera requires display  
	battery_pack excludes wireless  
